# =============================================================================
# .gitignore  --  Korean_Gut_MAGs
# Keep the repo to code + small reusable assets (trained model, carrier table).
# Large generated outputs and per-sample data are regenerated and not committed.
# =============================================================================

# Generated outputs / intermediates
**/output/
**/output_*/
*sample_x_ko*.tsv
*sample_x_ko*.csv
**/maaslin2/
**/maaslin_*/

# User-supplied input data (cohort/patient-level; format described in README)
07_ML_Prediction/input/
06_Linking/input/

# Large reusable assets — uncomment to exclude if you move them to Zenodo:
# 07_ML_Prediction/models/*.rds

# R / RStudio
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
